6.41 |\n| Land Area for Project | 2016.41 |\n| Permissible FSI | 5004.83 |\n| Sanctioned Build-up Area | 4032.22 |\n| Aggregate Area | 2016.41 |\n\n## Promoter Details\n\n|  |  |\n| --- | --- |\n| Promoter Type | Individual |\n| Promoter Name | MAHENDRA JAMNADAS KARA |\n| Communication Address | CHANDAVARKAR ROAD GROUND FLOOR TARGET THE MALL KARA WADI BORIVALI WEST OPP BMC OFFICE Mumbai Suburban MAHARASHTRA 400092 |\n\n## Project Configuration\n\n|  |  |\n| --- | --- |\n| TARGET THE MALL - Apartment Type | SHOP |\n| TARGET THE MALL - Carpet Area | 2501.0 |\n| TARGET THE MALL - No. of Apartments | 197 |\n\n|  |  |\n| --- | --- |\n| Professional 1 | ATUL AMRITLAL RANA |\n| Type | Architect |\n| Professional 2 | Divya Doshi |\n| Type | Chartered Accountant |\n\n## Bank Account Details\n\n|  |  |\n| --- | --- |\n| Bank Name | 76 |\n| IFSC Code | HDFC0000145 |\n| Bank Address | SHREERAM TRADE CENTRE CHAMUNDA CIRCLE BORIVALI WEST MUMBAI 400092 |\n\nThe information provided on this page is collated from publicly available resources. PropTech Pulse does not guarantee the accuracy, completeness, or authority of this data and shall not be held liable for any discrepancies. For queries or further assistance, please contact us at[pulse@aurumproptech.in](mailto:pulse@aurumproptech.in)\n\n## Top Properties in Navi Mumbai\n\n![Pexo Icon](/_next/image?url=%2Ffrontend%2Fassets%2Fpexo-ai%2Fpexo-strip.png&w=640&q=75)\n\n![Pexo Icon](/_next/image?url=%2Ffrontend%2Fassets%2Fpexo-ai%2Fpexo-strip.png&w=640&q=75)\n\nAsk Pulse Ai anything about real estate\n\nYour AI companion is available 24/7 — home loans, listings, market trends\n\n![pexo](/_next/image?url=%2Ffrontend%2FcommonAssets%2FshadowPexocha.webp&w=1200&q=75)\n\n## Unlock the Latest in Real Estate\n\nNews, Infographics, Blogs & More! Delivered to your inbox.\n\n[![Proptech Pulse Logo](/_next/image?url=%2Ffrontend%2FcommonAssets%2Fpulse_logo_latest.png&w=1200&q=75)](#home)\n\n### Reach Out to Us\n\n* Aurum Q1, Aurum Q Parć, Thane Belapur Road, Navi Mumbai 400710, India\n* [+91 22 6911 1800](tel:+912269111800)\n* [pulse@aurumproptech.in](mailto:pulse@aurumproptech.in)\n\n### Reach Out to Us\n\n* Aurum Q1, Aurum Q Parć, Thane Belapur Road, Navi Mumbai 400710, India\n* [+91 22 6911 1800](tel:+912269111800)\n* [pulse@aurumproptech.in](mailto:pulse@aurumproptech.in)\n\n### Reach Out to Us\n\n* Aurum Q1, Aurum Q Parc, Thane Belapur Road, Navi Mumbai 400710, India\n* [+91 22 6911 1800](tel:+912269111800)\n* [pulse@aurumproptech.in](mailto:pulse@aurumproptech.in)\n\n### “Data that drives action. Insight that inspires action. Technology that empowers action.“\n\n### “Data that drives action. Insight that inspires action. Technology that empowers action.“\n\nMade with Love\n\n![Statue](/frontend/assets/aurum-kuberx/flag.webp)\n\n© PropTech Pulse 2026, All rights reserved.\n\n[Terms of Use](/pulse/terms-of-use) and [Privacy Policy](/pulse/privacy-policy)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/target-the-mall/121548/project","title":"Target The Mall, Borivali West, Mumbai - Price on Request","raw_content":"![Squareyards Logo](/assets/images/squareyards.png?aio=w-82;h-32;crop;)\n![Mahendra Jamnadas Kara developer logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/mahendra-jamnadas-kara-29296-5948.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n\n# Target The Mall Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Target The Mall Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/target-the-mall-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-1140;h-350;crop;)\n\n**Price on Request**\n\n## Why Invest Through Square Yards?\n\n![Zero brokerage icon](/assets/images/zero-brokerage.svg)\n\n### Zero Brokerage\n\n100% Service, 0% Brokerage\n\n![Lowest price icon](/assets/images/lowest-price.svg)\n\n### Lowest Price Guaranteed\n\nHighly unlikely, but if you find a lower price anywhere, tell us and we will match it.\n\n![Full service support icon](/assets/images/full-service-support.svg)\n\n### Full Service Support\n\nOur sales personnel are accountable for every step.\n\n## Target The Mall Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Target The Mall.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Retail Shop  87 Sq. Ft. | **Price on Request** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nBorivali West's average asking price is cooling quarter-on-quarter.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Borivali West |\n| --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 30900 |\n| Mar 2026 | 31300 |\n| Dec 2025 | 30300 |\n| Sep 2025 | 30350 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| Borivali West | ₹ 30,900 |\n| [Amar 21 Business Elites](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/amar-21-business-elites/195390/project \"Amar 21 Business Elites\") | ₹ 24,250 |\n| [Rughani Arcade](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/rughani-arcade/286351/project \"Rughani Arcade\") | ₹ 21,250 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Borivali West ranges from ₹ 22.1 K to ₹ 74.4 K with options available for STUDIO,1,2,3 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Target The Mall | In Borivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 32.7 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 45.5 K |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 74.4 K |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Target The Mall.\n\n#### Mumbai's Water Stock at 95.97% with Seven Lakes Holding High Levels\n\nMumbai's water stock has reached 95.97%, with seven lakes maintaining high levels. This ensures a stable water supply for the city, though civic authorities continue to monitor reservoir levels and rainfall.\n\nA total of 5 residential transactions has been registered so far for Target The Mall, amounting to ₹ 2 Cr till September 2026.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### Mumbai-Pune Expressway 'Missing Link' Project Set for May 1 Inauguration, Promising Safer and Faster Travel\n\nThe highly anticipated 'Missing Link' project on the Mumbai-Pune Expressway is set to be inaugurated on May 1, significantly reducing travel time by approximately 30 minutes and enhancing safety. The 10.5-km stretch features tunnels and a bridge, bypassing the accident-prone Khandala Ghat. This infrastructure upgrade is expected to ease traffic congestion, improve travel safety.\n\n### Govt. Registrations\n\n5 Sales Transactions Registered in Target The Mall From Oct 25 to Sep 26 .\n\n| Sales Transactions | Gross Sales Value | Registered Rate |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 5 | ₹ 2 Cr | - |\n\nTransaction Period Oct 25 to Sep 26\n\n## Target The Mall Floor Plans\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 87 Sq. Ft. Retail Shop in Target The Mall, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:Price on Request\n\n## Amenities & Specifications of Target The Mall\n\n### Convenience Convenience\n\n![Convenience](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/convenience/am-ico-powerbac-active.svg)\n\n### Safety Safety\n\n![Safety](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/safety/am-ico-24x7secu-active.svg)\n\n### Leisure Leisure\n\n![Leisure](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/leisure/am-ico-cafecoff-active.svg)\n\n### Environment Environment\n\n![Environment](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/environment/am-ico-normalpa-active.svg)\n\n### Specifications\n\n## Location and Connectivity Around Mahendra Jamnadas Kara Borivali West\n\n![Connectivity map showing nearby places around Mumbai Western Suburbs](/assets/images/project-map.png?aio=w-714;h-317;crop;)\n\nEstimate commute from your office or kid's school to Target The Mall.\n\n![Car travel mode](/assets/images/car-fill.svg)\n![Target The Mall](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/target-the-mall-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-112;h-96;crop;)\n\nPlease select the starting point to calculate the travel time.\n\n![Rolling loader icon](/assets/images/rolling-loader.gif)\n\n### Nearby Landmarks\n\n#### Gokhale Education Society\n\n#### Pandya Hospital\n\n#### Netrajyoti Eye Care Centre\n\n### Connecting Roads\n\nAverage Asking Price in Borivali West\n\nBased on active listings and recent trends\n\nWestern Express Highway & SV Road\n\nLimited social amenities and infrastructure\n\nBorivali West attracts me since my experiences feel subdued and balanced. Nearby markets daily and excellent schools are good. Weekend beach time and runs close to SGNP are something I like. Andheri and Goregaon are simple for me to work in. Parking problems and traffic jams call for quick solutions.\n\n— Suresh Sanghvi, Tenant\n\n## RERA Details of Target The Mall\n\n## Property Registration Data\n\n5 Sales Transactions Registered in Target The Mall From Oct 25 to Sep 26 .\n\n| Registry Date | Floor/Unit | Tower/Wing | Area | Transaction Value | Rate/Sq. Ft. | Actions |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 2026-03-28 | Floor 4, Unit 423 | N/A | 103 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2026-03-28 | Floor 4, Unit 412 | N/A | 176 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2025-12-17 | Floor 4, Unit 416 | N/A | 143 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2025-12-02 | Floor 4, Unit 405 | N/A | 198 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2025-10-31 | Floor 4, Unit 421 | N/A | 110 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n\n## How does Target The Mall compare with similar projects?\n\n![Target The Mall project in Borivali West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-target-the-mall-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Target The Mall](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/target-the-mall/121548/project \"Target The Mall\")\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Rustomjee Eaze Zone Mall project in Malad West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-rustomjee-eaze-zone-mall-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Rustomjee Eaze Zone Mall](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/rustomjee-eaze-zone-mall/106202/project \"Rustomjee Eaze Zone Mall\")\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![Soni Shopping Centre project in Borivali West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-soni-shopping-centre-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Soni Shopping Centre](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/soni-shopping-centre/127105/project \"Soni Shopping Centre\")\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\nSend one enquiry to all selected projects and compare up to 4 options side-by-side.\n\n## Mahendra Jamnadas Kara Track Record\n\n![Mahendra Jamnadas Kara logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/mahendra-jamnadas-kara-29296-5948.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Suyash Shopping Centre residential project in Goregaon East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-suyash-shopping-centre-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nGoregaon East, Mumbai\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Rustomjee Eaze Zone Mall residential project in Malad West](https://static.squareyards.com/